# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(m*n)$$
- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int findTheDistanceValue(int[] arr1, int[] arr2, int d) {
        int m = arr1.length;
        int n = arr2.length;
        int count = 0;
        
        for(int i = 0; i < m; i++) {
            boolean valid = true;
            for(int j = 0; j < n; j++) {
                if(Math.abs(arr1[i] - arr2[j]) <= d) {
                    valid = false;
                    break;
                }
            }
            
            if(valid) {
                count++;
            }
        }
        
        return count;
    }
}
```
